# 统一换行符：仓库内与检出时一律 LF；需要在 Windows 上保留 CRLF 的类型在下方单独列出
* text=auto eol=lf

# 源码与文档一律 LF
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做转换、不参与 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.exe  binary
*.dmg  binary

# 语言统计：把设计文档与仓库元数据排除在代码占比之外，避免虚高
WorkDaddy-QoderCN-转换方案.md linguist-documentation
PROVENANCE.md linguist-documentation
SECURITY.md   linguist-documentation
NOTICE        linguist-documentation
LICENSE       linguist-documentation
